<section class="hero hero--split"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">CHEMKA · KIKULETWA · DAY TRIPS FROM MOSHI</p><h1>Chemka Hot Springs Tour from Moshi</h1><p>Plan a relaxing day trip to Chemka Hot Springs, also known as Kikuletwa Hot Springs. Contact Materuni Hosts to discuss your travel date, pickup point, group size and transport arrangements from Moshi.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://wa.me/255612068540?text=Hello%20Materuni%20Hosts%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20a%20Chemka%20Hot%20Springs%20day%20trip%20from%20Moshi.%20Please%20share%20the%20price%20and%20availability." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ask for Chemka price on WhatsApp</a><a class="text-link" href="/day-trips">Explore other day trips</a></div></div><aside class="destination-panel" aria-label="Chemka trip planning details"><span class="panel-kicker">DAY TRIP PLANNING</span><strong>Chemka</strong><span class="panel-subtitle">Kikuletwa Hot Springs</span><div class="panel-rule"></div><p>Pickup point</p><b>Moshi · Arusha · By arrangement</b><p>Before you travel</p><b>Confirm transport, entry fees and site conditions</b></aside></section>
<section><h2>Visit Kikuletwa Hot Springs on a day trip</h2><p>Chemka Hot Springs is also widely called Kikuletwa Hot Springs. It is a popular natural swimming stop for visitors staying in or travelling through the Moshi area. You can ask Materuni Hosts about arranging a day trip and transport for your group.</p><p>Travel time and road conditions depend on your pickup point, traffic and the route on the day. Confirm the pickup time and expected journey with your host before you travel.</p></section>
<section><h2>Chemka Hot Springs tour price</h2><p>The Chemka trip price is confirmed on request because transport, pickup location, group size and the services required affect the total. Ask for a clear per-person or private-group quote before you confirm. Any entrance or activity fees should be listed in the quote so you can see what is included.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://wa.me/255612068540?text=Hello%20Materuni%20Hosts%2C%20please%20quote%20a%20Chemka%20Hot%20Springs%20day%20trip.%20My%20group%20size%20and%20pickup%20point%20are%20to%20be%20confirmed." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request current price</a></div></section>
<section><h2>What to know before swimming at Chemka</h2><ul><li>Bring swimwear, a towel and a change of clothes if you plan to swim</li><li>Follow local safety guidance and any instructions at the site</li><li>Check conditions before entering the water</li><li>Keep valuables secure and take your rubbish with you</li></ul><p>Swimming access, site conditions and any local rules can change. Follow the guidance provided at the springs on the day.</p></section>
<section><h2>Chemka, Materuni and other Moshi day trips</h2><p>If you have more time in the area, compare a <a href="/materuni-waterfall-tour">Materuni Waterfall tour</a>, a <a href="/materuni-coffee-tour">Materuni coffee experience</a> or a <a href="/marangu-day-hike">Marangu day hike</a>. You can also ask for a combined itinerary based on your available days.</p></section>
